title: Wandering Scholar
portrait left: seeker
portrait right: scholar

scholar: Oh! A living one. You don't get many of those down here.
scholar: I can sharpen a technique, patch you up, or split my purse. Pick one; I'm in a hurry to be somewhere quieter.

choice:
  - Upgrade a card -> upgrade
  - Heal 15 -> heal
  - Take 40 gold -> gold

@upgrade
  > card upgrade choose 1
  scholar: Better. Not good. Better.
  > end

@heal
  > hp 15
  scholar: Stop bleeding on the books.
  > end

@gold
  > gold 40
  scholar: Don't spend it all on vials.
  > end
